{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_B38160B4","title":"Ava explains Nightmode","entry":"Dlg_B38160B4::entry","exit":"Dlg_B38160B4::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_35C6ACD0","articyId":"72057606922832923","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Nivalis gets so quiet at night. The curfew has almost everyone at home.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Nivalis gets so quiet at night. The curfew has almost everyone at home.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":-825.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31616","byteOffset":19841824,"byteLength":416}},{"id":"DFr_C8E1E262","articyId":"72057778721532765","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Well, not everyone plays by the rules. Being out at night is restricted but not deadly. Unless...","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well, not everyone plays by the rules. Being out at night is restricted but not deadly. Unless...","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":900.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20140","byteOffset":15504600,"byteLength":444}},{"id":"DFr_F49FDDDD","articyId":"72057778721532786","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"If I had to guess I'd assume serial killers move better at night. Though CorpSec has implemented quite a few safeguards to keep the populace contained--I mean safe.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"If I had to guess I'd assume serial killers move better at night. Though CorpSec has implemented quite a few safeguards to keep the populace contained--I mean safe.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":1475.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33734","byteOffset":20646232,"byteLength":472}},{"id":"DFr_5F303CBC","articyId":"72057778721532793","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Easier to buy and sell illegal items. Opportunity to get creative and 'visit' rival businesses, maybe leaving with a few things in hand.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Easier to buy and sell illegal items. Opportunity to get creative and 'visit' rival businesses, maybe leaving with a few things in hand.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":2061.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22378","byteOffset":16351592,"byteLength":444}},{"id":"DFr_1E7BF94F","articyId":"72057778721532815","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Between the security cameras and the drones, CorpSec has eyes at night. There's places you can hide though.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Between the security cameras and the drones, CorpSec has eyes at night. There's places you can hide though.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":3100.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50346","byteOffset":33388216,"byteLength":416}},{"id":"DFr_89FC8584","articyId":"72057778721532830","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Happy to be of service.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Happy to be of service.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":4050.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19774","byteOffset":15363856,"byteLength":372}},{"id":"DFr_A620127D","articyId":"72057606922834842","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Some people only come out at night. They'd have you believing their skin will burn if it meets the sun.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Some people only come out at night. They'd have you believing their skin will burn if it meets the sun.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":2411.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45207","byteOffset":31436280,"byteLength":456}},{"id":"DFr_57AEE055","articyId":"72057606922834851","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Shelters that have popped up across the city. If you find yourself on their radar, you can duck in one of those if you can't make it back to your apartment.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Shelters that have popped up across the city. If you find yourself on their radar, you can duck in one of those if you can't make it back to your apartment.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":3425.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18978","byteOffset":15066688,"byteLength":464}},{"id":"DFr_D90906DD","articyId":"72057787311471832","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"If you don't make it home before curfew, a local shelter will be provided for you. You are currently in it.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"If you don't make it home before curfew, a local shelter will be provided for you. You are currently in it.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":-225.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50423","byteOffset":33417696,"byteLength":416}},{"id":"DFr_8F58FB09","articyId":"72057787311471847","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"This is only temporary. Return to your apartment before curfew and you can sleep in your own bed.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"This is only temporary. Return to your apartment before curfew and you can sleep in your own bed.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":350.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43376","byteOffset":30740032,"byteLength":408}},{"id":"DFr_C027511A","articyId":"72057606922832930","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Almost?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Almost?","TextSheVersion":"Almost?","TextTheyVersion":"Almost?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":-525.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20633","byteOffset":15690792,"byteLength":288}},{"id":"DFr_C5C601C9","articyId":"72057778721532772","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Unless what?!","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Unless what?!","TextSheVersion":"Unless what?!","TextTheyVersion":"Unless what?!"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1163.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"23278","byteOffset":16688232,"byteLength":296}},{"id":"DFr_A05FE041","articyId":"72057778721532778","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Playe